SQL> ---------------------SCANARIO-4-----------------------------
SQL> SELECT CLAUSE HALI (DEPTNO) AND GROUP CLAUSE HALI(DEPTNO,SAL)->Its is not mandatory to pass the colname which is
SQL> present in the group by colname/expression-->mandatory ,while exceuting the output it check the combination
SQL> of multiple colmNs given in the group by clause
SQL> SELECT COUNT(*),DEPTNO
  2  FROM EMP
  3  GROUP BY DEPTNO,SAL;

  COUNT(*)     DEPTNO                                                                               
---------- ----------                                                                               
         1         10                                                                               
         1         20                                                                               
         1         20                                                                               
         1         10                                                                               
         2         30                                                                               
         2         20                                                                               
         1         30                                                                               
         1         20                                                                               
         1         10                                                                               
         1         30                                                                               
         1         30                                                                               
         1         30                                                                               

12 rows selected.
SQL> --IT WILL CHECK FOR DEPTNO=20
SQL> -- THEN IT WILL CHECK IF THEY FIND ANY DUPLICATE VALUE IN DEPTNO 10,20, 10 ,30 ,20
SQL> -- 10 IS REPEATED THEN IT FIND FOR NEXT COL_NAME ( SAL) CHECK FOR COMBINATION WITH (DEPTNO,SAL)
SQL> --IF THEIR COMBINATION IS NOT SAME THEN IT WILL PRINT 1 OR
SQL> -- IF NOT IT WILL PRINT ,HOW MANY TIMES IT IS REPEATED


 
SQL> -------------------SCANARIO-5------------------------------------------- 
SQL> ------------QUESTION USING WHERE CLAUSE---------------------------------
SQL>WAQTD NO EMPLOYEE PRESENT IN THE EACH DEPT IF THEY ARE WORKING AS SALESMAN ,CLERK,ANALYST
  1  SELECT COUNT(*) ,DEPTNO
  2  FROM EMP
  3  WHERE JOB IN ('SALESMAN','CLERK','ANALYST')
  4  GROUP BY DEPTNO;

  COUNT(*)     DEPTNO
---------- ----------
         5         30
         4         20
         1         10 
